{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Appulse_logo.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div>Discover <strong>pinball</strong> like never before with Appulse! The game is <strong>a roguelite shooter,</strong> where you protect a Galactic Federation ship! Upgrade your ball, your weapons and your ship to pushback waves of unwavering robots.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Title_01.png?t=1748855675\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div>Inspired by the <strong>classic pinball Space Cadet</strong> we loved during our childhood, Appulse is a reinterpretation of the genre. Bringing newcomers and old timers by mixing <strong>the juicy mechanics of the pinball</strong>, and the thrilling and <strong>fast</strong> <strong>gameplay of a roguelite shooter</strong>, we want to spark a new interest among the gamer community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We stayed faithful to the pinball legacy and designed a completely <strong>unique table</strong> for Appulse. In this game you are entirely immersed into a space war. Your goal is to <strong>protect the capital    </strong><br><br><strong>ship</strong> while he is cruising through space to escape the grasp of the robot syndicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Title_03.png?t=1748855675\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack is the best form of defence!  <br>Jump on enemies spaceships using <strong>your cannon</strong>. Challenges and special events await you in these unknown territories. <strong>Conquer ships</strong> to add them to <strong>your fleet</strong> and win the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Title_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div>  Do not worry, you are bringing <strong>your own arsenal</strong> to face the trouble!     <br><strong>Pick the weapon</strong> of your choice to destroy the tripods trying to destroy your ship. The twist to the way you play a regular pinball, is that you will be able to control your ball thanks <strong>to recoil when firing.</strong> Master this technique and you will be capable to go anywhere you want!    <br>\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/5.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns are not the only cards in your sleeve. Along the way you will <strong>power up your character</strong> thanks to special perks. Need more recoil when firing? Turrets to assist you in the ship's defense ? Or maybe the ability to slow down time to do the perfect action? You have the cards in your hands to create the perfect build!  <br> But be aware, they are all randomized, so you are guaranteed to have a unique run each time you put a coin in the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/4.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div><strong>Use your flipper with precision, craft your own build, defeat your foes and master the scoreboard!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498700?t=1748855675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498700?t=1748855675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/85656e618acf38fc050782df20ff519e6a7f7574/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748855675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/85656e618acf38fc050782df20ff519e6a7f7574/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748855675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Appulse_logo.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div>Discover <strong>pinball</strong> like never before with Appulse! The game is <strong>a roguelite shooter,</strong> where you protect a Galactic Federation ship! Upgrade your ball, your weapons and your ship to pushback waves of unwavering robots.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Title_01.png?t=1748855675\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div>Inspired by the <strong>classic pinball Space Cadet</strong> we loved during our childhood, Appulse is a reinterpretation of the genre. Bringing newcomers and old timers by mixing <strong>the juicy mechanics of the pinball</strong>, and the thrilling and <strong>fast</strong> <strong>gameplay of a roguelite shooter</strong>, we want to spark a new interest among the gamer community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We stayed faithful to the pinball legacy and designed a completely <strong>unique table</strong> for Appulse. In this game you are entirely immersed into a space war. Your goal is to <strong>protect the capital    </strong><br><br><strong>ship</strong> while he is cruising through space to escape the grasp of the robot syndicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Title_03.png?t=1748855675\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack is the best form of defence!  <br>Jump on enemies spaceships using <strong>your cannon</strong>. Challenges and special events await you in these unknown territories. <strong>Conquer ships</strong> to add them to <strong>your fleet</strong> and win the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/2.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/Title_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/TX_UI_Lines_02.png?t=1748855675\" /></div>  Do not worry, you are bringing <strong>your own arsenal</strong> to face the trouble!     <br><strong>Pick the weapon</strong> of your choice to destroy the tripods trying to destroy your ship. The twist to the way you play a regular pinball, is that you will be able to control your ball thanks <strong>to recoil when firing.</strong> Master this technique and you will be capable to go anywhere you want!    <br>\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/5.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns are not the only cards in your sleeve. Along the way you will <strong>power up your character</strong> thanks to special perks. Need more recoil when firing? Turrets to assist you in the ship's defense ? Or maybe the ability to slow down time to do the perfect action? You have the cards in your hands to create the perfect build!  <br> But be aware, they are all randomized, so you are guaranteed to have a unique run each time you put a coin in the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/4.gif?t=1748855675\" /></div><strong>Use your flipper with precision, craft your own build, defeat your foes and master the scoreboard!</strong></p>","developers":["LeRado"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/header.jpg?t=1748855675","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257102237,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102237/movie480.mp4?t=1741885258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102237/movie_max.mp4?t=1741885258"},"name":"Appulse - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257102237/a1cb90bc075254bba9eb1e4e5325f90f1ba65bb5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741885258","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102237/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741885258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102237/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741885258"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257149629,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149629/movie480.mp4?t=1748855673","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149629/movie_max.mp4?t=1748855673"},"name":"Appulse - Gameplay Overview - May 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset